<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTUGUESE CUP SIXTH ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTUGUESE CUP SIXTH ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of sixth round matches in</p>
<p>the Portuguese Soccer Cup on Sunday:</p>
<p> Salgueiros	2 Porto	     3</p>
<p> Boavista	  2 Infesta	   0 </p>
<p> Estrela Amadora 1 Sandinenses     2 </p>
<p> Portimonense    2 Estoril	   3 </p>
<p> Setubal	   1 Braga	     2-after extra time (90 mins:</p>
<p>1-1)</p>
<p> Benfica	   3 Desportivo Aves 1-after extra-time (90 mins:</p>
<p>1-1)</p>
</text>
